[00:03.20]Shhhhh…
[00:05.70]keep it sweet…
[00:08.22]pretty boys only bleed on screen…
[00:12.00]One more dance with what you buried deep…
[00:17.57]Shhhhh…
[00:20.91]don’t look down…
[00:24.91]love sounds better underground…
[00:33.61]Eleven years old with her wavy hair
[00:36.43]blind little trust in a cold spotlight
[00:39.88]Hello Kitty shoes on the backseat cold
[00:43.09]waiting seven years in devotion’s hood
[00:46.27]You sang from your sister’s closet
[00:48.73]like a saint with a stolen wound
[00:52.51]but she never got a shelter
[00:55.42]where she could whisper on her own
[00:59.13]White petals fed on borrowed blood
[01:02.03]You played detective in your myth
[01:04.56]while something real began to rot
[01:12.06]Your verses passed right through her
[01:14.57]while she dressed in pink and white
[01:18.00]the album blooms while she withers
[01:21.09]out of frame, out of sight
[01:24.46]That scarlet thread looked more like wire
[01:27.43]small feet stilled in pink kitten shoes
[01:30.73]White coffin trailing close like guilt
[01:33.55]black trunk holding secrets still
[01:38.64]keep it sweet…
[01:41.34]pretty boys only bleed on screen…
[01:45.06]One more dance with what you buried…
[01:51.20]let it rot…
[01:54.00]love sounds better when it’s not…
[01:57.71]smile and stream…
[01:59.84]no little ghost inside the machine…
[02:04.15]don’t say her name…
[02:08.80]the car still knows…
[02:11.98]the songs still play…
[02:15.97]From your sister’s room
[02:18.70]to the front trunk of your car
[02:21.61]from “I can’t say what I’m feeling”
[02:24.85]to a body left too far
[02:28.65]Sweet rot
[02:29.57]black bag
[02:30.19]parking tickets
[02:30.90]summer heat
[02:32.96]Nobody opens it
[02:33.85]everybody streams
[02:34.90]just 70 pounds beneath the dream
[02:41.30]That white coffin followed
[02:42.90]your tour like a prayer
[02:44.71]until that black mouth opened wide
[02:49.18]and the silence found air
[02:59.06]keep it sweet…
[03:01.50]pretty boys only bleed on screen…
[03:04.65]One more dance with what you buried…
[03:11.10]let it rot…
[03:14.49]love sounds better when it’s not…
[03:17.56]smile and stream…
[03:19.91]no little ghost inside the machine…
[03:23.49]You didn't make a muse
[03:25.07]you made a grave
[03:26.74]for a kid.
[03:28.70]You didn’t write love
[03:30.09]you taught it to decay
[03:31.95]You didn’t save her
[03:33.30]you fed the stage
[03:35.05]You didn’t mourn her
[03:39.04]you monetized the ache
[03:42.45]FRONT TRUNK
[03:43.01]SWEET ROT
[03:43.73]BLACK BAG
[03:44.52]HOT LOT
[03:45.30]PARKING TICKETS
