[03:46.96]NOBODY OPENS IT
[03:48.39]EVERYBODY STREAMS
[03:55.94]THE ALBUM BLOOMS
[03:57.58]WHILE SHE WITHERS
[04:04.72]Shhhhh…
[04:05.89]keep it sweet…
[04:08.07]In the front of my car, you
